	"data": "Cover Letter Christopher DiCarlo\n\nAugust 20, 2020\nDesigning Digitally \nFranklin, OH 45005\nRe: Simulation Developer\nDear Hiring Manager,\nI am applying for the position of Simulation Developer. \nI am very interested in this position. I believe I am a strong fit for this work, including experience with Unity, C#, and 3D modelling. \nI have been studying and developing programs with Unity and C# for the last couple of years and have a high degree of knowledge and interest in simulation development.…",
